        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "2c6b3416-d07f-5f30-835e-27ec99f4c5ca",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Luke Rockhold, Chris Weidman, Anderson Silva, Jamill Kelly, Daniel Cormier, Cain Velasquez\n- Organizations: UFC, American Kickboxing Academy\n- Roles: Middleweight Champion, guest wrestling coach\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, Chris Weidman became the first man to defeat Anderson Silva inside the UFC and became the Middleweight Champion.\n- Chris Weidman held the Middleweight Champion title for approximately two and a half years.\n- In 2015, Jamill Kelly became a guest wrestling coach for Daniel Cormier, Luke Rockhold, and Cain Velasquez at the American Kickboxing Academy.\n- On December 12, 2015, Luke Rockhold won the title by defeating prior champion Chris Weidman via fourth-round TKO.\n- At the time Luke Rockhold defeated him on December 12, 2015, Chris Weidman was an undefeated prior champion.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
