        "text": "Page: Luke Rockhold. Sentence: He won the title on December 12, 2015 by defeating prior champion, the undefeated Chris Weidman via 4th round TKO.\nPage: Chris Weidman. Sentence: In 2013, he earned worldwide prominence by becoming the first man to defeat Anderson Silva inside the UFC to become the Middleweight Champion, which he held for approximately two and a half years.\nPage: Jamill Kelly. Sentence: In 2015, he became a guest wrestling coach for Daniel Cormier, Luke Rockhold and Cain Velasquez, all from the American Kickboxing Academy.",
